OrionLayer open fix 71, amended — a battle command's action waits nothing either
================================================================================

Work order 212 (Part C, the measurement of 210's four cases again). orion2re on
`orionlayer-local`, on top of open fix 77. Every line under ORION2RE_EXT.

Fix 71 keeps the first wait after an input poll: in the idle battle it is
the input loop's own tick. But after a battle command is taken (CEV_COMMAND
with result 0, open fix 58) the action runs at once, and its first wait is
an animation frame — 110 ms of the Stellar Converter's first frame, kept
before this. A taken command now clears the poll mark.

diff --git a/src/ext/ext_api.cpp b/src/ext/ext_api.cpp
